% references.bib — single bibliography for the project.
%
% RULES (SOP-020 §4). These are not optional:
%   1. An entry is added only AFTER a human has opened the source and confirmed
%      title, authors, venue and year.
%   2. A claim is attributed to a paper only after a human has located that claim
%      IN that paper — not in its abstract, and not in someone else's summary of it.
%   3. AI-suggested references are [UNVERIFIED] until 1 and 2 are done. Language
%      models fabricate plausible citations and mis-attribute real ones.
%   4. Cite the published version where one exists; note the arXiv ID as well.
%
% Convention: citekey = firstauthorlastname + year + firstsignificantword
% Every entry must carry doi or eprint.
